		(descr "MARV V2 mounting hole: 4.0 mm plated through hole for a 3 mm silicone grommet, grounded 6.4 mm diameter pad ring (all copper layers, exposed) stitched by eight 0.6/0.3 mm vias on a 2.7 mm radius, and a 6.5 mm diameter front courtyard for the grommet flange -- the flange itself, not the flange plus a hand clearance. The ring replaces the 5.0 mm copper keepout of MountingHole_4.0mm_Grommet: the hole now ties the frame screw to GND on every layer. No 3D model.")
